        "question_Nq8kVX": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does it take to see results?",
            "answer": "<p>Many customers start noticing changes in <strong>energy, peace, and positivity within a few days to a few weeks</strong>. Results may vary based on placement, belief, and environment.</p>",
