            "answer": "<p>Placement depends on the product and purpose. You will receive a <strong>direction-wise placement guide</strong> with your order. For any confusion, our team is available on <strong>WhatsApp support</strong>.</p>",
            "product_type": "all"
          }
        },
        "question_h6UTff": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use more than one Vastu product together?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Multiple Vastu products can be used together as long as they are placed as per the provided guidelines. Many customers combine remedies for better results.</p>",
